{'symbol': 'ICE', 'date': '2022-01-06 08:00:00', 'title': 'ICE ANNOUNCES THAT A RECORD 27,876 MICRO NYSE FANG+™ INDEX FUTURES TRADED ON JANUARY 4', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE, INC. (NYSE:ICE), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF DATA, TECHNOLOGY, AND MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT A RECORD 27,876 MICRO NYSE FANG+™ INDEX FUTURES TRADED ON JANUARY 4, 2022. “2021 WAS A REMARKABLE YEAR FOR THE U.S. TECHNOLOGY SECTOR AND THERE HAS BEEN A LOT OF ATTENTION ON THE FAANG STOCKS AND THE NYSE FANG+™ INDEX, INCLUDING THE RECENT ADDITION OF MICROSOFT® STOCK TO THE INDEX,” SAID DAVID GOONE, CHIEF STRATEGY OFFICER AT ICE.'}